@startuml wt_decision_recovery
title Recovery of an interrupted WT decision
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
participant "Boomlet A" as A
participant "Other four Boomlets" as P
participant "Candidate WT" as C

note over A,P
  The five reviewed intents identify one frozen switch.
  A may have emitted PREPARE or COMMIT.
  Trusted bounded admission permits recovery after timeout or cancellation.
end note

alt A complete final decision certificate is available
  P -> A: Five matching COMMIT signatures and decision evidence
  A -> A: Verify and learn completed decision, even below current promise
  A -> P: Relay final certificate for convergence
else No final certificate is available
  A -> A: Admit next successor within trusted allowance
  A -> A: Persist higher ballot and exact highest-certificate report
  A -> P: RECOVER(target ballot, prepared certificate or NONE)
  P -> P: Each peer persists its higher promise and exact report
  P -> A: Four RECOVER reports with prepared certificates or NONE
  A -> A: Verify all five reports, certificates, scope and own exact report
  P -> P: Each independently verifies the five-report collection\nand its own exact stored report
  note over A,P
    A higher promise forbids creating lower-ballot votes.
    Reports are immutable; delayed prepared proofs cannot reopen old ballots.
  end note

  alt At least one valid prepared certificate is reported
    A -> A: Select the value of the highest-ballot certificate
    P -> P: Independently compute the same selection
  else Every report is NONE
    A -> A: Select ABORT
    P -> P: Independently select ABORT
  end

  A -> A: Persist PREPARE for selected value in target ballot
  A -> P: PREPARE with verifiable recovery collection
  P -> A: Four matching PREPARE votes
  A -> A: Verify and durably retain complete PreparedCertificate
  A -> A: Persist matching COMMIT
  A -> P: COMMIT
  P -> P: Each verifies five PREPARE votes, retains their certificate,\nand persists matching COMMIT before export
  P -> A: Four matching COMMIT votes
  A -> A: Verify final DecisionCertificate
  A -> P: Complete DecisionCertificate
end

alt Final value is ABORT
  A -> A: Persist tombstone; unlock only the matching predecessor operation
  P -> P: Preserve local ceremony and all outstanding obligations
else Final value is ACTIVATE
  A -> A: Install certified candidate head from retained evidence
  P -> P: Install the same certified head
  A -> C: Final certificate when candidate is reachable
  opt Candidate is unavailable
    ref over A,C
      Start a fresh reviewed switch from the installed head.
      Choose another WT in the fixed roster.
    end ref
  end
end

note over A,C
  Recovery requires five cooperating peers and retained evidence.
  Prepared activation proves every honest signer discharged its frozen duty.
  Finishing the decision requires no new candidate or SAR response.
  A superseded recovery ballot retries at a higher ballot.
end note
@enduml
